{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Import Axis Conversion.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Import Axis Conversion.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender import axis conversion blender import axis conversion","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Import Axis Conversion.md","fileName":"Blender Import Axis Conversion.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Import Axis Conversion","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 01:18\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Portable 3D Model Data]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Portable 3D Model Data","creatinggameenvironmentsinblender3d.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Import Axis Conversion.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Import Axis Conversion.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender import axis conversion blender import axis conversion","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Import Axis Conversion.md","fileName":"Blender Import Axis Conversion.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Import Axis Conversion","heading":"Blender Import Axis Conversion","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Graphics applications may disagree about which axis points up or forward and about the unit scale represented by one coordinate. Import and export conversion maps those conventions so an asset arrives with the intended orientation and size.\n\nChanging axes is not merely cosmetic when animation, cameras, armatures, or parent-child transforms are present. A pipeline should test a reference object with known dimensions and direction before transferring a complete environment.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Portable 3D Model Data","creatinggameenvironmentsinblender3d.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Import Axis Conversion.